<description>&lt;p&gt;The rebuilt flood-damaged town is being promoted as a showcase for the Libyan strongman’s rule while armed groups such as the Fezzan Revolutionaries Force continue to contest Haftar’s control in the south. The House of Representatives speaker criticised Tripoli for blocking a parliamentary session in Zintan, and the Zintan airport closure sparked further parliamentary clashes. Large quantities of cocaine and millions of pills were seized in eastern Libya as trafficking networks expand. The UN welcomed new laws criminalising the conscription of minors and raising the recruitment age to 18. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOUF92cEV2aUZOZTdpZzRjNVk1dzVCTjhkaUVGODZyem1EQzhvckhpNkc3a3FseW1JVzdZTmFyWEcyMU03Z2RoWnZxUmt0ZWtFZFJXMzlMWmtzM3JhVWJ5c0ZwTTVKcWVsODhjS1I4X21laFFaeVZMY3drUUliLUlDT21kMnpYQ0hjQ2JfQlVnbkVpMDlvSERvNkwxaU5BWkUzYmpXbWdPSk1VdmpFLWhPMjQ0YXhQaFBGUERuNW04WjhpdVU?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQZzNVX2NPYXpBVE1pZmVJOEdPcnJJeVYtcW5LTThGcHNuWFY5dnFFQXZhUGdxQURCd00wWndoVWdGNGRxM0xPOUR4T3IwVVNyXzl4enl0dlB1OHV0N0xvSlJ2d2JVaUJZbjJFYnJSX0Z1NkJ1dmRJSXk4NWxwRjV0Z29ZUkJJQmJIQWJ2end0TGpDc1ppcDZ2ZG54T0NWYkVlNWRKOE1R?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1LNWtaVkVtaWR5blozTVduaVhRQXp2UEJhakxwMHhERGpxN2dxSmJzWnpRVktBWHllUWRGb1VacnZlTDFidGxCamNCUWNlQVdTZFpRRnVPM181aEE5TXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNd2t1SlZXaldlbkFiaDRWcWpaTHBmX2VNa094QVRZSkxSMmtaTHVtX2ltWWF5RE42aEZFVGtuRzAzbU9KalFGS0Y4VkNwdksxS3Jsd1Mta3JuVUF3WkZMRGQ0WS10S0RfMU1FZ2lBQ3pmRElhZEVqSU9XZVExd0NIRHlOWGxDTXhKREtHX2ZENnF1cEhiNFVv?oc=5&quot;&gt;The L